		(uuid "18625789-7225-4736-a3ea-9aa26f5f67fb")
	)
	(text "Q1 SOA RELEASE GATE\nProve IPB020N10N5LF at the hot corner: approximately 66 W inferred maximum power limit and 66.5 ms maximum TIMER interval.\nDo not substitute Q1 using RDS(on) alone. Validate current/power limits and startup on hardware."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 178.562 18.288 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "201e33b9-1b46-40b6-ad34-825ea71630b7")
	)
	(text "R17/R18 are Kelvin sense traces from the R1 pads. U4 VBUS intentionally measures after Q1."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 195.58 99.06 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2761a200-8095-4141-9bac-9b039feac66d")
	)
	(text "RELEASE BLOCKER — U3 DEVICE / FOOTPRINT VERIFICATION\nSymbol: TI LM5069MM-2; fitted device: Maxinmicro LMX5069MS (C47967145).\nObtain/archive the exact Maxinmicro datasheet; verify pinout, thresholds, TIMER/retry behavior, package, and footprint.\nU3 pad-to-pad clearance is 0.15 mm vs. the board's 0.20 mm rule; approve a local fab rule or revise the footprint/rules."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 93.98 76.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.9 0.9)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3b72aeea-5f20-4172-97f7-cacb43996b1e")
	)
	(text "Default OFF:\n  R8/R9 drive Q2 on unless PC14 drives Q3.\n  LMX5069 auto-retries; STM32 observes PD_PGOOD and may remove PD_ENABLE."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 194.818 64.262 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5d8ba6ad-1cf2-4950-9386-d7c236c12871")
	)
	(text "CAN-FD PHYSICAL LAYER"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 102.87 207.01 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "64b51bce-0487-4dc9-a5c9-dd6fe11faeee")
	)
	(text "CAN PLACEMENT: keep D2, L3, and U5 close to J1 (connector → D2 → L3 → U5).\nPlace C15/C16 directly at U5 VCC/VIO. Route CAN_BUS_P/N and CAN_PHY_P/N as differential pairs; P = CANH, N = CANL.\nKeep each pair short, tightly coupled, symmetric, and length-matched. Route CAN_TX/CAN_RX/CAN_STB over continuous ground, away from switching nodes."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 23.876 221.742 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6de2126d-fc12-4e90-ab3d-eed5726a61ca")
	)
	(text "SW3538 IRQ/ONLINE2 -> PD_IRQ\nDefault: active-low ONLINE2 indication.\nIRQ mode: set Reg0x11[7]; clear Reg0x20 pending flags before enabling Reg0x28 sources."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 335.28 66.04 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "987a0812-8c1e-46b9-bd82-a07f015f3e56")
	)
	(text "ASSEMBLY CHECK: verify U3/U4/Q1/MOD1 package pin numbering and footprints against manufacturer drawings."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 200.406 153.416 0)
		(effects
			(font
